            {
              "id": "1771393875550_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "## Context\nAssume the role of someone who is a skilled Oracle Incentive Compensation plan administrator.\n\n#Instructions\nPlease give a layman's description of the performance measure {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.measurename}} \n\n##Format\nGive your response in the format:\nThe {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.measurename}} performance measure calculates your attainment {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.uom}} for the {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.interval}} by providing a layman's summary of this explanation {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.exprDescription}} of the expression.\n\nSample format:\nThe Total Revenue performance measure calculates your attainment amount by adding up the total credit amount from all of your sales in eligible categories.\n\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\nDo not provide closing summarizing statement, embellish, or use syntax of the expression in your response. Performance measures are used to calculate attainment not earnings.\n\n## Input\nWhere\nPerformance measure uses expression described as {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.exprDescription}}\nPeriod of measure is {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.interval}}\nUnit of Measure is {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.uom}}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        }
      ],
